# ML-DSA keys, certificates and signatures from OpenSSL.
#
# Generated by scripts/capture_mldsa.py. Do not edit: every value
# here is OpenSSL's, and the tests that read it need no OpenSSL.
#
# OpenSSL 3.5.4 30 Sep 2025 (Library: OpenSSL 3.5.4 30 Sep 2025)
#
# PEM bodies are written as one line of base64. `[key]` holds one
# key per parameter set in the three forms of RFC 9881 section 6;
# `[signature]` messages are byte i = (7 i + 3) mod 256.
#
# Counts, asserted by the test that reads this:
#   key                      3
#   certificate              4
#   signature                24

